  messages:
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: g eveing
    delayBeforeMs: 600
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 063a05ddc5e696b4c9fc74d6ffee4663, type: 2}
    text: good evening
    delayBeforeMs: 600
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 942d308b9135ce84ea52cf067182a246, type: 2}
    text: Hello!!
    delayBeforeMs: 500
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 942d308b9135ce84ea52cf067182a246, type: 2}
    text: How is everyone doin?
    delayBeforeMs: 400
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 917cec5e14bb0194ea10a5b2396f6a23, type: 2}
    text: Evening everyone, having a splendid night, especially with what we have lined up.
    delayBeforeMs: 1200
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: ye
    delayBeforeMs: 500
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: im super excited
    delayBeforeMs: 600
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 063a05ddc5e696b4c9fc74d6ffee4663, type: 2}
    text: whats the info for the new dungeon?
    delayBeforeMs: 900
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 917cec5e14bb0194ea10a5b2396f6a23, type: 2}
    text: "That's the fascinating part, there are no release notes."
    delayBeforeMs: 1100
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 917cec5e14bb0194ea10a5b2396f6a23, type: 2}
    text: It was just opened up on what I only surmise to be a whim by the devs.
    delayBeforeMs: 700
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 063a05ddc5e696b4c9fc74d6ffee4663, type: 2}
    text: that cant be. its always some type of stunt for player engagement
    delayBeforeMs: 900
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 063a05ddc5e696b4c9fc74d6ffee4663, type: 2}
    text: drum up theories and attention for next years plotline
    delayBeforeMs: 600
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 942d308b9135ce84ea52cf067182a246, type: 2}
    text: Like an ARG!
    delayBeforeMs: 500
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 942d308b9135ce84ea52cf067182a246, type: 2}
    text: Or a really weird bit!
    delayBeforeMs: 400
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 063a05ddc5e696b4c9fc74d6ffee4663, type: 2}
    text: maybe.
    delayBeforeMs: 800
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 917cec5e14bb0194ea10a5b2396f6a23, type: 2}
    text: "If it is a new ARG, I doubt they'd make it like the last one. I swear if they do that again, I am NEVER coming back to lore hunting."
    delayBeforeMs: 1400
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: theories are interesting and all
    delayBeforeMs: 800
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: "but none of these thoughts will be answered if we don't get into the dungeon."
    delayBeforeMs: 700
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 917cec5e14bb0194ea10a5b2396f6a23, type: 2}
    text: "You don't enjoy theorycrafting when you watch a good show, Apollo?"
    delayBeforeMs: 1000
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: "there's nothing in making theories"
    delayBeforeMs: 700
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: "it's more interesting seeing if you're right or not"
    delayBeforeMs: 500
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: "it'll be more fun inside the dungeon instead of talking"
    delayBeforeMs: 500
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 942d308b9135ce84ea52cf067182a246, type: 2}
    text: "Then let's get going! What are our roles, dude?"
    delayBeforeMs: 800
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7c8b3d4a2e1f5a6b9c0d8e7f6a5b4c3d, type: 2}
    text: "[ tutorial.exe initialized ]"
    delayBeforeMs: 1200
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7c8b3d4a2e1f5a6b9c0d8e7f6a5b4c3d, type: 2}
    text: "Before entering the dungeon, assign a party role to each character."
    delayBeforeMs: 800
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7c8b3d4a2e1f5a6b9c0d8e7f6a5b4c3d, type: 2}
    text: "Tap a character's portrait to open their profile."
    delayBeforeMs: 900
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7c8b3d4a2e1f5a6b9c0d8e7f6a5b4c3d, type: 2}
    text: "Set their Party Role to match their Preferred Role for the best results."
    delayBeforeMs: 1000
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7c8b3d4a2e1f5a6b9c0d8e7f6a5b4c3d, type: 2}
    text: "When all four roles are assigned, log in to begin the run."
    delayBeforeMs: 1000
    typingDurationMs: 0
  - sender: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1a2b3c4d5e6f70819203a4b5c6d7e83, type: 2}
    text: "okay. i'm logging in."
    delayBeforeMs: 900
    typingDurationMs: 0
